      "statement": "The authentication boundary is implemented with AWS Cognito and OIDC: the auth CDK stack provisions the user pool, app client, hosted UI domain, and a pre-token-generation Lambda that adds a namespaced email claim to access tokens so backend JWT validation can derive user identity without calling `/userinfo`.",
